3,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm excited to help. I'm worried about whether we can actually finish the work on time. Maybe we should check the local firms and the site's history?,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start, Kenji. However, I suspect the real challenge lies in the gap between a beautiful drawing and the messy reality of rain and foot traffic.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello... I just wonder who will take care of the flowers and the grass every day. Will there be enough people to help?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Benjamin. We often see impressive openings that deteriorate quickly. I want to know how previous city projects are actually holding up after several years.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I share Minako's concern. I am particularly interested in the long-term financial burden. We must ensure the city can afford the upkeep once the project is finished.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, that makes sense! But if the ground is tricky, the costs might go up during construction. I want to see if the earth-moving firms are reliable.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. I'm curious about the actual patterns of movement. If we build a path where people don't walk, we've simply wasted money on a decorative line.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Kenji, do you think the people who work there now are tired? I want to know if there are volunteers who like the park.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, volunteers are helpful, but they cannot fix poor construction. I believe we need to look at the condition of works from the earlier programme.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. To understand the future, we must look at the past. I'll be looking into the actual spending per hectare to see the real costs.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the regional firms and the depot notes. I want to know if the site hoarding and phasing are realistic for this city's timing.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall investigate the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts. It would be a tragedy to design a park that floods every August.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I think I will look at the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups. I want to see who is really doing the work.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting. I want to see what survived.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will focus on the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll. I need to see the balance between staff and spending.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Sounds like a plan! Let's see what we find.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A logical division of labor. I look forward to the revelations.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we find a way to make it easy for the people working there.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,Let us proceed. The facts will guide us.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Let us see if the numbers support the visions.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
